---
---
<section class="section bg-warm">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--secondary-text)">Pipeline + Enrollment</span>
    <div class="feature-split reverse">
      <div class="feat-text">
        <span class="script script-xl" style="color:var(--secondary-text)">Inquiry to Enrolled. Connected.</span>
        <h2 class="headline">One pipeline. No spreadsheets.</h2>
        <p class="subhead">Lead management, public enrollment forms, onboarding automation, and a task inbox. Prospective records convert into real student profiles when families commit.</p>
        <div class="feat-points">
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-teal">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><line x1="19" x2="19" y1="8" y2="14"/><line x1="22" x2="16" y1="11" y2="11"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--text)">Lead pipeline kanban</strong><br>Stage counts, stagnation indicators, drag-to-advance</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-teal">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="8" height="4" x="8" y="2" rx="1" ry="1"/><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><path d="M12 11h4"/><path d="M12 16h4"/><path d="M8 11h.01"/><path d="M8 16h.01"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--text)">Public lead form</strong><br>Token-linked multi-student intake to your real database</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-teal">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"/><path d="M21 3v5h-5"/><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"/><path d="M8 16H3v5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--text)">Onboarding automation + task inbox</strong><br>Multi-step dispatch, staff routing, automated task rules</span>
          </div>
          <div class="feat-point">
            <div class="feat-point-icon solid solid-teal">
              <svg aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3"/><path d="M6 21V9a9 9 0 0 0 9 9"/></svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong style="color:var(--text)">One record, inquiry to classroom</strong><br>A lead becomes a real student profile on enrollment, no re-typing anything</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div><a href="#" class="btn btn-founding" data-cta="Learn More">Learn More</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="feat-visual">
        <div class="blob" aria-hidden="true" style="background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(0,171,189,.16),transparent 68%);width:120%;height:120%;top:-10%;left:-10%"></div>
        <div class="shot"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1747" height="1416" src="/images/lead-pipeline.webp" alt="Lead pipeline board"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
